  "text": "Bilkul 😊 Agar **shaadi ke liye budget mein** saree chahiye, toh main ₹1,000–₹3,000 ke range mein **Banarasi, organza, georgette aur tissue silk** ko priority dungi. Current online options mein kaafi achhe pieces mil rahe hain. [hotdeals360.com](https://hotdeals360.com/fashion/wedding-guest-guide-elegant-ethnic-sets-and-sarees-under-3-000-10938544?utm_source=chatgpt.com)[utsarees.in](https://utsarees.in/collections/saree-under-2000?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n### [Banarasi Organza Silk Saree]()\n*₹1,999*\n\n### [Banarasee Floral Embroidered Work Saree]()\n*₹1,899*\n\n### [Banarasi Georgette Saree]()\n*₹1,000*\n\n### [Bridal Lace Work Banarasi Saree]()\n*₹1,999*\n\n### [Banarasi Silk Saree]()\n*₹1,599*\n\n### [Yashika Vichitra Silk Saree]()\n*₹1,199*\n\n### Meri top picks 💃\n\n- **₹1,500–₹2,000:** **Banarasi organza** — shaadi mein classy aur expensive-looking lagti hai. UT Sarees par Banarasi organza options around ₹1,599–₹1,999 dikh rahe hain. [hotdeals360.com](https://hotdeals360.com/fashion/wedding-guest-guide-elegant-ethnic-sets-and-sarees-under-3-000-10938544?utm_source=chatgpt.com)[utsarees.in](https://utsarees.in/collections/saree-under-2000?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n- **₹1,500–₹2,500:** **Banarasi georgette** — lightweight, comfortable aur traditional look ke liye best.\n- **₹1,800–₹2,500:** **Tissue silk** — reception/sangeet ke liye thodi glamorous.\n- **₹2,000–₹3,000:** **Semi-Banarasi/Tussar** — comparatively sophisticated look; Prashanti par current options ~₹1,600–₹2,000 se mil rahe hain. [www.prashantisarees.com](https://www.prashantisarees.com/en-us/collections/sarees-under-3000?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n- **₹1,000 ke aas-paas:** Floral/printed georgette — agar multiple shaadi functions ke liye 2–3 sarees leni hain.\n\n**Ek important tip:** ₹1,000–₹2,000 ki saree ko “pure silk/handloom Banarasi” kehne wale listings se thoda careful rehna. Is budget mein aksar art-silk, power-loom ya Banarasi-style fabric hota hai; genuine handwoven Banarasi generally mehengi hoti hai. [thepanaya.com](https://thepanaya.com/blogs/the-panaya/best-banarasi-sarees-under-rs-5000?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\nAgar tum mujhe **budget (₹1,000 / ₹1,500 / ₹2,000 / ₹3,000), skin tone aur shaadi mein role (bride ki sister/friend/cousin/guest)** bata do, main tumhare liye **5–7 exact sarees shortlist** kar dungi.",
